              "sourceContext": "NI KC Chemie SekII2022, Makromoleküle und Nanostrukturen, printed page32: polymer types, molecular structure/property explanation and selected polymer functionality. NI KC printed page50 A6 also lists the possible alternative teaching unit „Vom Kautschuk zum High-Tech-Reifen“.",
