              "sourceContextAndLimits": "Original RP2022 physical/printed21 explains W/WP columns;26 places6.1-6.5 in GK electives;28 puts6.1-6.3 in the LK elective-compulsory pool (at least30 of53 hours overall, not every block);29 leaves6.4 history elective. Pages47-49: radiation/colour mixing/chromophore foundation; LK donor/acceptor and azo synthesis-mechanism addita; dyeing/health/environment6.3; history/economy6.4. A specific vat method and every scientific P transfer are own operational detail, not universal official whole credit.",
              "wholeUnchangedAcquisitionScope": "Actual source lookup of the two stated EFSA primary pages with locator/access record, then substance identity, matched use/exposure and limited health evidence. No completed research, actual approval, toxicology ranking by natural/synthetic origin or dose is fabricated.",
              "compilerScopeSemantics": "Only this supported jurisdiction is an explicit own-acquisition scope input. Current tags and unchanged listed authored views limit course placement; metadata is not stage/course enforcement, and views remain CrossStage. Raw applicability is the before-field, not a new compiled pass.",
