              "officialWholeSourceCredit": false,
              "sourceContextAndLimits": "Original BW BP2016/V2 physical10/printed8 distinguishes Basisfach overview with exemplary depth from Leistungsfach higher modelling/mathematics. Physical42/printed40 3.4.8(4), Leistungsfach only, names dyes among examples of a further selected research substance group. This supplies no universal complete dye course, no choice by an individual and no GK duty for the four authored basic dye targets.",
              "wholeUnchangedAcquisitionScope": "Given wool/cellulose groups, ionic and hydrogen-bond affinity, conditional wash performance; supplied reactive-triazine substitution versus disperse-dye polyester uptake, with photochemical and matrix limits. The correct eb753 predecessor stays; no complete SN1/SN2 course is newly required.",
              "compilerScopeSemantics": "Only this supported jurisdiction is an explicit own-acquisition scope input. Current tags and unchanged listed authored views limit course placement; metadata is not stage/course enforcement, and views remain CrossStage. Raw applicability is the before-field, not a new compiled pass.",
