              "officialWholeSourceCredit": false,
              "sourceContext": "Joint Berlin-Brandenburg RLP Chemie2022, printed/physical26 and53-55. P26 defines common GK content and additional LK column. P53 common corrosion includes local cells, oxygen/acid corrosion and sacrificial protection; p54 actual corrosion investigation is separate. P55 offers rust/aluminium contexts.",
              "sourceLimit": "The full c95 goal/P is an explicit SkillPilot extension: explain observed departure from simple potential ranking through dense passive films/porous rust and use material/phase/environment data to judge aluminium and alloys, with chloride/crevice/repassivation limits. This is not official exact whole-source credit, a practical investigation, a nanomaterial/coating-production duty or proof of a learner-selected context.",
              "wholeAcquisitionScope": "Both original DE/EN cases and all four current expectations remain: thermodynamic tendency vs rate; protective film vs porous rust; conditional environment-based use judgment; alloy/chloride/data limits. Figures and costs are synthetic supplied model conditions, not current product evidence.",
